        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "@echasnovski Thanks for responding so quickly :)\r\n\r\nYour hesitation makes a lot of sense.  I think preserving consistency is always a good idea. Plus this isn't really a critical feature request, and it seems like it could be quite a bit of effort to implement and maintain across all the mini modules. I'll mark this issue as closed for now.\r\n\r\nIf you ever change your mind and want to re-open this issue, I'd be happy to help you experiment to find a solution that could fit all 10 modules. Perhaps with something like `MiniLogHeader` linking to `WarningMsg`, or whatever you think works best.\r\n\r\nAnyways thanks for all your great work on this project! I think mini.nvim is a really inspiring project! ",
